      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You can find veins on the Qion Tundra, in the Qion Valley and in the Frozen Wastes. The Frozen Caves have the richest veins, and they also have the worst company.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
