      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "It is straight and dry, and it will rack up nicely. I will have the racks built before the shipment comes, if it ever does. Here is your pay.",
